        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although there is no legal authority directly on point, we believe that, for purposes of determining whether we are a PFIC, the gross income we derive or are deemed to derive from the time chartering activities of our wholly-owned subsidiaries more likely than not constitutes services income, rather than rental income.",
        "start_character": 128715,
        "end_character": 129035
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company provides logistics services and commercially manages its fleet primarily from offices in Newport, Rhode Island, Copenhagen, Denmark, Southport, Connecticut, and Singapore.",
        "start_character": 16189,
        "end_character": 16372
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company provides ocean transportation services utilizing a fleet of ocean-going motor vessels (“m/v”) in the Handymax, Supramax, Ultramax, Panamax and Post-Panamax segments.",
        "start_character": 1446,
        "end_character": 1623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To add value, the Company offers a wide range of logistics services beyond the traditional loading, carriage and discharge of cargoes.",
        "start_character": 17502,
        "end_character": 17636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage market risk by chartering in vessels for periods of less than nine months on average and through a portfolio approach based upon owned vessels, chartered-in vessels, COAs, voyage charters, and time charters.",
        "start_character": 4775,
        "end_character": 4992
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "4.For our chartered-in fleet we seek to employ the most fuel efficient designs available;",
        "start_character": 38769,
        "end_character": 38858
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of March 16, 2026, the Company operates its fleet of 39 owned or partially owned vessels, which are described in the table below:",
        "start_character": 18838,
        "end_character": 18970
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Correspondingly, we believe that such income does not constitute “passive income”, and the assets that we or our wholly-owned subsidiaries own and operate in connection with the production of such income, in particular, the vessels, do not constitute passive assets for purposes of determining whether we are a PFIC.",
        "start_character": 129036,
        "end_character": 129352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For purposes of determining whether we are a PFIC, we will be treated as earning and owning our proportionate share of the income and assets, respectively, of any of our subsidiary corporations in which we own at least 25% of the value of the subsidiary’s stock.",
        "start_character": 128135,
        "end_character": 128397
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In any year that the 5 Percent Override Rule is triggered with respect to us, we are eligible for the exemption from tax under Section 883 only if we can nevertheless satisfy the Publicly-Traded Test (which requires, among other things, showing that the exception to the 5 Percent Override Rule applies) or if we can satisfy the 50% Ownership Test.",
        "start_character": 118950,
        "end_character": 119298
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001606909-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001606909-26-000010-1bb22a2709d696ce",
        "accession_number": "0001606909-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to determine the persons who actually or constructively own 5% or more of our common shares, or 5% Shareholders, we are permitted to rely on those persons that are identified on Schedule 13G and Schedule 13D filings with the U.S.",
        "start_character": 117092,
        "end_character": 117330
      },
      {
